      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_024shk_1_5_024_01:1_5_024_01:cmd-000010:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:33d8451285d4e5f69626e1f5771ddc007ba751ec655f29067561078d2496c78f",
      "text": "工作",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_024shk_1_5_024_01:1_5_024_01:cmd-000010:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6cc541f41399bfbb6cf575e53b8054e570277117b7191b17c24610a7218f7da2",
      "text": "润喉糖广告的工作",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_024shk_1_5_024_01:1_5_024_01:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8a8fd8d8f3433f541c63d7d33b2fb5ed0b04c88aa0d2ab68c5499f1e87721694",
      "text": "四季先生，润喉糖广告的工作定下来了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_024shk_1_5_024_01:1_5_024_01:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4b865f96528f4a0707e1964ace1a5287ca2742eb778fd6b71be948e600f248c0",
      "text": "哦哦——！真的假的，\n●●●●プロデューサー酱！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_024shk_1_5_024_01:1_5_024_01:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:90d0178148694aa4bf644e8d69393f5a98655f914a0d16893898bf1b8b289529",
      "text": "说到润喉糖那可是主唱的必备品。\n能被选上拍广告真是超级Mega高兴的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_024shk_1_5_024_01:1_5_024_01:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1eab8561911714379f5f8f3d099b0bf6cd02f4298c65ae59423aff16996eaa10",
      "text": "拍摄用的润喉糖是水果味的。\n收到了样品，请用吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_024shk_1_5_024_01:1_5_024_01:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:00e9e9c69e4ded2ef17f8636a3db125133875c1ea3e55315709984a2146e99ec",
      "text": "谢谢啦！\n那我就不客气，开——吃——啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_024shk_1_5_024_01:1_5_024_01:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d6ccfc460f7326ee02b7737e6445c7b820516f05179c206619135bfbfe6f1f65",
      "text": "嗯嗯？这、这是……！？\n对嗓子超级见效的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_024shk_1_5_024_01:1_5_024_01:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:24f4382d2994c7f67eb4e1bef9e70f7c341e17fee9ba95a41410a319fc329865",
      "text": "咦？一吃下去马上就能感觉得出来吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_024shk_1_5_024_01:1_5_024_01:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f36dc80bd9dcc5c39d103f2f3f79e73235e046209ba59e50a3559652fc645a5a",
      "text": "感觉啦，是感觉。超绝Mega Hyper厉害的哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_024shk_1_5_024_01:1_5_024_01:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8bb4bd3e96ea2a7324cc0fa2208c4265081838a554cb06adf8c6e1105977bec8",
      "text": "原来如此，感觉确实很重要呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_024shk_1_5_024_01:1_5_024_01:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1b402647fedcde9e0201d93998e1ec170aedd66640f200722d69ed506e527ce2",
      "text": "没错！拍摄我也会加油的。\n要好好期待着哦☆",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
